  https://github.com/libvips/libvips.
- The web UI uses the Geist and Geist Mono typefaces (SIL Open Font License 1.1), downloaded at
  build time and served by the app itself.

The repository's Python (the accuracy benchmark harness in benchmarks/, the scripts in scripts/,
and their development tools) is not part of ArchSim's product and ships in no image; the
benchmarked services the harness builds (benchmarks/service-*) install their own dependencies at
build time.

Technology logos in the web UI come from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org, CC0-1.0). The
logos are trademarks of their respective owners. ArchSim uses them only to identify the
